.TH "INSPEKT\-SAVE" "1" "2026\-04\-16" "Inspekt 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
inspekt\-save \- Save the current page as a self\-contained HTML file.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]inspekt\f[R] \f[B]save\f[R] [\f[I]OPTIONS\f[R]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Save the current page as a self\-contained HTML file.
.PP
Uses SingleFile to capture the complete DOM state including:
.IP \(bu 2
JavaScript\-rendered content
.IP \(bu 2
Embedded images, fonts, and CSS
.IP \(bu 2
Current scroll position and form states
.PP
\f[B]Options:\f[R]
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-o, \-\-output\f[R]: Output file path
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-d, \-\-dir\f[R]: Output directory (default: current directory)
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-\-no\-images\f[R]: Skip embedding images (faster, smaller)
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-\-remote\-images\f[R]: Keep image URLs instead of embedding
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-\-optimize\f[R]: Enable aggressive optimization for large pages
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-\-compress\f[R]: Compress HTML output
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-\-open\f[R]: Open saved file after completion
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-\-reveal\f[R]: Reveal in file explorer after completion
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]\-o\f[R], \f[B]\(enoutput\f[R], \f[I]PATH\f[R]
Output file path (default: auto\-generated from title)
.TP
\f[B]\-d\f[R], \f[B]\(endir\f[R], \f[I]DIRECTORY\f[R]
Output directory (default: current directory)
.TP
\f[B]\(enno\-images\f[R]
Skip embedding images (faster, smaller file)
.TP
\f[B]\(enremote\-images\f[R]
Keep images as remote URLs instead of embedding (requires internet to
view)
.TP
\f[B]\(enno\-styles\f[R]
Skip removing unused styles (keep all CSS)
.TP
\f[B]\(eninclude\-scripts\f[R]
Include JavaScript in saved page (disabled by default)
.TP
\f[B]\(eninclude\-frames\f[R]
Include iframe content (disabled by default)
.TP
\f[B]\(encompress\f[R]
Compress HTML output (remove extra whitespace)
.TP
\f[B]\(enraw\f[R]
Save raw page without processing (useful for debugging)
.TP
\f[B]\(enoptimize\f[R]
Optimize for smaller file size (removes unused styles/fonts, recommended
for large pages)
.TP
\f[B]\-q\f[R], \f[B]\(enquiet\f[R]
Suppress progress output
.TP
\f[B]\(enjson\f[R]
Output result as JSON (for scripting)
.TP
\f[B]\(enopen\f[R]
Open saved file in default application
.TP
\f[B]\(enreveal\f[R]
Reveal saved file in file explorer
.SH EXAMPLES
.IP
.EX
inspekt save
inspekt save \-o page.html
inspekt save \-\-no\-images
inspekt save \-\-optimize \-\-compress
inspekt save \-\-open
inspekt save \-o mypage.html
inspekt save \-d \(ti/archives
inspekt save \-\-remote\-images
inspekt save \-\-include\-scripts
inspekt save \-\-compress
.EE
